Bright Coffee Shop Sales – Data Analysis Project
This project explores sales data from Bright Coffee Shop to uncover meaningful trends, performance patterns, and actionable insights.
The aim is to help the business make data-driven decisions that improve revenue, customer engagement, and operational efficiency.

Project Purpose
The goal of this analysis is to:
Identify daily, weekly, and monthly sales trends
Understand which products contribute the most to revenue
Highlight customer purchasing behavior
Detect patterns in peak business hours
Reveal opportunities to increase sales and optimize operations

Key Insights You Can Expect
This project uses a combination of SQL, Python, and visual analytics to produce insights such as:
Top-selling products
Sales performance by category (e.g., beverages, pastries, etc.)
Average order value and transaction trends
Seasonal or time-based patterns
Store performance comparisons (if multi-location)
Recommendations based on discovered trends

Tools & Technologies
BigQuery (SQL analysis & data processing)
Python / Pandas (data cleaning & transformation)
Power BI / Tableau (visual dashboards)
GitHub (project documentation & version control)
